<title>THAILAND: Siam Syntech year profit surges 289 pct.</title>
<headline>Siam Syntech year profit surges 289 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited consolidated financial results for 12 months ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (In millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 4.71	 vs	   1.21</p>
<p>    Net			147.17	 vs	  37.85</p>
<p>Note: Revenue not stated. The construction company's full name is Siam Syntech Construction Plc.</p>
